Migration — `prisma/migrations/20260828150236_phase1_domain_schema/migration.sql`:
Prisma-generated DDL, then a hand-written tail:
- `zippy_reject_mutation()` PL/pgSQL function — `RAISE EXCEPTION` with a hint.
- `job_events_append_only` and `ledger_entries_append_only` triggers,
  `BEFORE UPDATE OR DELETE ... FOR EACH ROW`.
- `REVOKE UPDATE, DELETE ... FROM PUBLIC` on both tables (defence in depth for
  the non-privileged app role later phases connect as).

Seed — modular under `prisma/seed/`, orchestrated by `prisma/seed.ts`:
- `client.ts` — one PrismaClient, `todayAt(hour, minute)`, `START_OF_YEAR`.
- `zones.ts` — 6 Bengaluru zones (`seedZones`, `zoneId`).
- `capabilities.ts` — 12-code catalogue (`seedCapabilities`, `capabilityId`).
- `parts.ts` — 8 categories, 22 parts (`seedParts`, `partId`, `partCategoryId`).
- `pricing.ts` — one active price list "Standard 2026", a `part_prices` row per
