  tenant-less DISPATCHER login (`seedTenants`).
- `technicians.ts` — 31 technicians + users; `capabilitiesFor(i)` gives the
  uneven matrix (EV 2, key 3, OBD 18, basics 31); `shiftFor(i)` gives three
  partially-overlapping bands plus a night band.
- `fleet.ts` — 24 units (12 VAN, 6 BIKE, 4 FLATBED_TOW, 2 WHEEL_LIFT_TOW) with
